  "id": "secondary-appraisal",
  "term": "secondary appraisal",
  "definition": "Secondary appraisal is the stage after an initial emotional interpretation in which a person turns that reaction into a practical response or coping behavior. In the source context, employees use this stage to decide how to act toward customers, such as how much recovery effort to provide.",
